#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md:25
#: e6c3dce2008b4f36bf47d9735ca5523c
msgid ""
"What `./init.sh all` does: initialize submodules, create a Python "
"**3.12** env (from `.fa-env.toml` `backend`: `uv` or `conda`), then "
"install `ros2_robot_interface`, `ros2-viser`, `vr_pose_publisher`, and "
"`xr_hand_retarget`."
msgstr "`./init.sh all` 会做：初始化子模块，按 `.fa-env.toml` 的 `backend`（`uv` 或 `conda`）创建 Python **3.12** 环境，然后安装 `ros2_robot_interface`、`ros2-viser`、`vr_pose_publisher` 和 `xr_hand_retarget`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md:27
#: 354cc29ec395444bae87aad2825301b6
msgid ""
"Switch backend with `./init.sh set-backend uv`. Personal overrides: `.fa-"
"env.local.toml`."
msgstr "用 `./init.sh set-backend uv` 切换 backend。个人覆盖：`.fa-env.local.toml`。"

