#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md:57
#: 6d98de889b184b9a87c967f2a902cdc9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Headset SKU notes and the hand-tracking steps live on [VR "
"Teleop](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md) ({ref}`Hand "
"tracking <vr-hand-tracking>`). Pico **Enterprise** supports USB shared "
"networking (USB 网络共享) and uses a **different App** from Pico "
"**consumer**. This page lists the fa-py-libraries README commands. It "
"does not name store listings, package names, or ADB steps."
msgstr "头显规格和手部追踪步骤见 [VR 遥操作](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)（{ref}`手部追踪 <vr-hand-tracking>`）。Pico **企业版** 支持 USB 网络共享，并使用与 Pico **消费版** 不同的 App。本页列出 fa-py-libraries README 里的命令。商店条目、软件包名和 ADB 步骤不在本页。"

